WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.103 --> 00:00:16.204
walked to the gym after the first day of school.

2
00:00:17.565 --> 00:00:19.366
Usually she loved going to Kids Central.

3
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:21.807
But today she felt sad.

4
00:00:24.229 --> 00:00:27.170
Bobby was playing soccer, so he wasn't coming back this year.

5
00:00:27.951 --> 00:00:29.972
And Jason's dad was working from home now.

6
00:00:30.836 --> 00:00:33.097
That meant Jason wasn't coming back either.

7
00:00:34.057 --> 00:00:34.718
She sighed.

8
00:00:35.998 --> 00:00:39.320
"Kids Central is going to stink this year."

9
00:00:42.681 --> 00:00:46.642
As she entered the gym, Izzie saw Nina and Ethan sitting at a table.

10
00:00:46.662 --> 00:00:50.604
"Nina!" Izzie hugged her friend.

11
00:00:50.624 --> 00:00:52.685
"Hi, Ethan!"

12
00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:55.006
Ethan looked very tan.

13
00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.386
And his hair was long!

14
00:00:56.406 --> 00:01:00.008
"Welcome back, everyone," Miss Shelly said.

15
00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:02.525
"I have a surprise to share with you.

16
00:01:03.185 --> 00:01:04.345
I—" Boom!

17
00:01:04.825 --> 00:01:06.386
Just then the door flew open.

18
00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.346
And Bobby walked in—on crutches!

19
00:01:09.366 --> 00:01:12.547
"No soccer for me," he said.

20
00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:16.028
"I broke my leg jumping into the river this summer."

21
00:01:16.048 --> 00:01:18.649
"Ouch," Ethan said.

22
00:01:18.669 --> 00:01:22.250
"We're happy to see you, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

23
00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:24.110
The door opened again.

24
00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:25.231
Nina gasped.

25
00:01:26.071 --> 00:01:30.072
"Jason?" Jason came into the gym, grinning.

26
00:01:31.104 --> 00:01:33.025
"My dad is working at his office again.

27
00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:35.187
So I'm back at Kids Central!"

28
00:01:36.348 --> 00:01:37.168
Nina clapped.

29
00:01:37.869 --> 00:01:39.770
"We're all together again!"

30
00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.312
"Miss Shelly, what are we doing today?"

31
00:01:43.573 --> 00:01:44.353
Jason asked.

32
00:01:44.373 --> 00:01:45.994
"I hope we're cooking!"

33
00:01:47.615 --> 00:01:50.377
Miss Shelly shook her head and pointed to three tables.

34
00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:53.079
Each table had different things on it.

35
00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.741
"We're making time capsules."

36
00:01:55.761 --> 00:01:57.922
"For time travel?"

37
00:01:58.262 --> 00:01:59.003
Bobby asked.

38
00:01:59.023 --> 00:02:04.169
"Cool!" "Not exactly," Miss Shelly said.

39
00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:07.872
"You'll put items in the capsules today.

40
00:02:09.052 --> 00:02:12.034
Then we'll save them for a date in the future.

41
00:02:14.355 --> 00:02:17.177
It will feel like time travel when you open them."

42
00:02:17.197 --> 00:02:19.518
"What do we do first?"

43
00:02:19.758 --> 00:02:20.559
Bobby asked.

44
00:02:21.459 --> 00:02:22.880
"Go to the first table.

45
00:02:23.681 --> 00:02:27.243
We'll make handprints and take photos," Miss Shelly said.

46
00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:34.101
"Ooh, I'm making pink handprints!"

47
00:02:36.762 --> 00:02:39.362
Izzie carefully traced her hands with a pink marker.

48
00:02:39.382 --> 00:02:43.583
"They look like flamingos."

49
00:02:43.604 --> 00:02:46.124
"Say 'cheese.'"

50
00:02:49.465 --> 00:02:52.066
Miss Shelly snapped photos of Izzie and the other kids.

51
00:02:55.347 --> 00:02:57.607
The next station had pencils and clipboards.

52
00:02:58.568 --> 00:02:59.868
Izzie picked up a clipboard.

53
00:03:00.548 --> 00:03:03.771
"Now we're supposed to write things about ourselves."

54
00:03:04.992 --> 00:03:06.053
She ran to Ethan.

55
00:03:06.073 --> 00:03:10.296
"I'll fill out yours, and you can fill out mine."

56
00:03:11.177 --> 00:03:11.998
Ethan nodded.

57
00:03:12.018 --> 00:03:15.661
"What's your favorite food and activity?"

58
00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:16.701
Izzie asked.

59
00:03:16.721 --> 00:03:20.244
"Fish tacos and surfing," Ethan said.

60
00:03:20.264 --> 00:03:21.605
"What's yours?"

61
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:27.350
"Easy. Strawberry ice cream and kickball," Izzie said.

62
00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.452
"Next question.

63
00:03:30.172 --> 00:03:32.033
What do you want to learn this year?"

64
00:03:32.053 --> 00:03:36.455
"How to build a rocket ship," he answered.

65
00:03:36.475 --> 00:03:40.276
"I want to learn how to play the trumpet."

66
00:03:41.677 --> 00:03:43.738
Soon Izzie moved on to the next table.

67
00:03:44.858 --> 00:03:47.740
She saw empty paper towel rolls and tissue paper.

68
00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.541
"What's the tissue paper for?"

69
00:03:51.021 --> 00:03:51.841
Nina asked.

70
00:03:52.682 --> 00:03:55.443
Miss Shelly held up an empty paper towel roll.

71
00:03:55.463 --> 00:03:57.904
"This will be your capsule.

72
00:03:59.076 --> 00:04:02.757
After you put everything inside, wrap it in tissue paper.

73
00:04:04.057 --> 00:04:07.938
Then seal the time capsule with tape and decorate it."

74
00:04:09.139 --> 00:04:10.739
The kids nodded and got to work.

75
00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.961
Izzie slipped her paper, handprints, and photo into the capsule.

76
00:04:17.681 --> 00:04:19.361
Next she wrapped it in green tissue.

77
00:04:22.162 --> 00:04:24.583
She smiled happily as she looked up at her friends.

78
00:04:24.603 --> 00:04:28.544
"I was wrong," she thought.

79
00:04:29.405 --> 00:04:31.953
"This year is going to be awesome!"
